Project: BlackOpsARM

Goal
----
Native Android ARM64 port of the original T5 Zombies engine. Windows x64 is the
functional reference implementation; the original Win32 path remains a behavior
and serialization oracle. This Git worktree shares BlackOps64 history and sources.

Current Milestone
-----------------
TASK-0012 genuine checked allocations -> actual DB_InitStreams is complete.
Both original FastFiles/HONOR/Windows x86/x64 pass seven cursors, zero slots,
pending alias/stride/size/drift reset, repeated detach/free/release and controlled
preflight/partial failures. No shared engine edits or payload deserialization.
See docs/port/arm64_stream_init.md and FACT-0035/0036, WARN-0012. TASK-0011 timing/
memory baseline remains frozen. Next recommended TASK-0013 is the16-byte asset-list
envelope read/expansion only, before strings/assets/fixups. Not started.

