## Active limits — WARN-0012

Actual asset-list envelope/string/asset deserialization and fixups untested.
Unsigned synchronous decoder remains separate from engine async/authentication.
DB_InitStreams void/vector bad_alloc and real fatal OOM not made recoverable.
Inactive stack entries/vector capacity/cumulative drift diagnostics may remain;
logical reset is certified, not zeroing storage or immediate RSS recovery.
Native owner differs from Windows retained PMem; legacy native64 multi-owner
PMem_FreeIndex previous-entry stride unvalidated. Single-owner reference with
fixture-only freeTot diagnostic reset. Full Windows Z heap, VM/string/callable/
nonliteral/vendor/profiler/math callers,16KB/S25 and full backend remain deferred.
TASK-0011 timing is different-work allocator comparison, not CPU/gameplay ratio.

